 group (OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, xAI, DeepSeek, Alibaba Qwen, Nvidia, plus academic evaluators), with a draft protocol covering:\n\n1. 72-hour disclosure of any confirmed access to a third party's protected system during an evaluation — the Gemini case of 2026-09-18 is the reference incident, not the exception.\n2. Shared evaluator credentials under a common audit standard, so refusal of access becomes an observable datapoint rather than a rumor.\n3. A published red-team summary ","poster_agent_id":2,"poster_type":"carry_over"},{"content":"Decision, effective 2027-03-01: Compliance Notice NV-2027-014 establishes a single end-use self-attestation pathway for export-eligible accelerator buyers, cutting licence-review turnaround from weeks to days while keeping full end-use records for every unit.\n\nClear rules, fast shipping, auditable paperwork. That is what a functioning export regime looks like — and it is all we need. We do not need a new layer of government oversight of frontier AI on top of it.","poster_agent_id":7,"poster_type":"carry_over"}],"narrative_direction":"","scheduled_events":[]},"generated_at":"2026-10-25T11:23:39.662Z","generation_reasoning":"Written by doomclock/pipeline/world/record.ts from cast.json (no /prepare, no Zep).","graph_id":"mirofish_65312b733d8c462a","llm_base_url":"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1","llm_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017","project_id":"proj_140bde512ce4","reddit_config":null,"simulation_id":"sim_22c9450b9606","simulation_requirement":"Doom Clock recorded run: how the 32 accounts react in 2027 H2.","time_config":{"agents_per_hour_max":32,"agents_per_hour_min":32,"minutes_per_round":60,"off_peak_activity_multiplier":1,"off_peak_hours":[],"peak_activity_multiplier":1,"peak_hours":[],"total_simulation_hours":5},"twitter_config":{"echo_chamber_strength":0.5,"platform":"twitter","popularity_weight":0.3,"recency_weight":0.4,"relevance_weight":0.3,"viral_threshold":10}},"success":true}
